==Trivia==
The rhoa is conceptually based on the real-world [[wikipedia:Moa|moa]], a large, flightless bird that was native to New Zealand but is now extinct. The name "rhoa" is a combination of "rhino" and "moa".<ref name="Rhino Moa" />

